    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπᾰγε</span></b> , (imper. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>away!
